   1:Source/util/pdtimer.c **** /*
   2:Source/util/pdtimer.c ****  * PlutoBrowser — pdtimer.c
   3:Source/util/pdtimer.c ****  * Timer framework (Phase 4). See pdtimer.h for the contract.
   4:Source/util/pdtimer.c ****  *
   5:Source/util/pdtimer.c ****  * Implementation: fixed-capacity array of timer records (the Lua reference
   6:Source/util/pdtimer.c ****  * never has more than a handful of timers live; 64 slots is generous). A timer
   7:Source/util/pdtimer.c ****  * whose callback fires is removed; a callback may schedule new timers safely
   8:Source/util/pdtimer.c ****  * (new entries are appended after the iteration window if needed — we simply
   9:Source/util/pdtimer.c ****  * note the growable case and let it be picked up next frame).
  10:Source/util/pdtimer.c ****  */
